		{
			dependencies: ["0F473004BDE8A486"]
			description: [
				"GregTech 的维护没你想的那么糟（保证！），带这个舱门的组合方块看起来超酷的！"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"大多数多联块都需要一个&3维护舱口&r。您需要先进行维护，多联块才能开始运行。"
				""
				"在背包中备齐 &9Wrench&r、&9Screwdriver&r、&9Soft Mallet&r、&9Hammer&r、&9Wire Cutter&r 和 &9Crowbar&r，打开 Maintenance Hatch 并 &e点击中心点一次&r即可。 &c无需单独移动工具&r。"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"或者，你可以在维护舱里放一个&9Tape&r来绕过这些问题，但很多人会跳出来告诉你 Tape 是&o\"不道德的\"&r——而且，Tape 还被 MV Age 锁着。"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Maintenance problems have a &d5%&r chance of occuring every &dhour of multiblock activity&r. Needless to say, they are &6very&r rare. Each maintenance problem increases recipe duration by 10%. Fixing the problems is done the same way as above."
				""
				"At &6HV&r age, you will unlock other Maintenance Hatches that do not require manual repairs."
			]
			id: "6644AAD403127EFB"
			shape: "rsquare"
